  "details": "I was wondering if you guys could make it so users can decorate their default home world to personalize them and make them unique. Maybe have a world to go \"shopping\" and you can put the items in a theoretical bag and open the bag only at the store and in your home. Also maybe add some games to play, more furniture that you can also \"buy\", or something. I feel lots (including myself) would like to be able to make this our own little area.",
